  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An ideal fluid of density <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>, flows smoothly through a bent pipe (as shown in figure) that tapers in cross-sectional area from a to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. The pressure difference between the wide and narrow sections of pipe is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi></math>. At wider section, the velocity of fluid is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo></math>_____ . (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0086_d5088c782001.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 113px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "363",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0086_d5088c782001.png\" style=\"width: 290px; height: 113px;\" /></p><p>From equation of continuity,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>From Bernoulli&#39;s theorem,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#961;</mi><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#961;</mi><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>4100</mn><mn>800</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>121</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>363</mn></msqrt><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>363</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
